							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700;">⭐ Perfeito: Dinâmico e memorável</td>
						</tr>
						<tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #ecfdf5;">
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700; color: #16a34a;">4–5 Minutos (Ponto Ideal)</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700; color: #16a34a;">520 – 650 palavras</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700; color: #16a34a;">440 – 550 palavras</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">Pai / Mãe dos Noivos</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 700;">⭐ Ideal: Histórias e emoção equilibradas</td>
						</tr>
						<tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #fdfbf7;">
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700;">6 Minutos</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">780 palavras</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">660 palavras</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">Votos dos Noivos Conjuntos</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; color: #d97706; font-weight: 600;">⚠️ Limite máximo; corte piadas internas</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-red);">7+ Minutos</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: var(--accent-red);">900+ palavras</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: var(--accent-red);">770+ palavras</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: var(--accent-red);">Zona de Risco</td>
							<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; color: var(--accent-red); font-weight: 700;">❌ Muito Longo: Convidados inquietos</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- SEO Article & Comprehensive Guide -->
		<article class="hand-card" style="padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); margin-bottom: 4rem;">
			
			<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
				<span class="badge-postit">Manual de Oratória & Brindes</span>
				<h2 class="font-heading" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); color: var(--fg-pencil); margin-top: 0.5rem; text-align: center;">
					Guia Completo para Escrever e Cronometrar o Discurso de Casamento
				</h2>
				<p class="font-body" style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 750px; margin: 0.5rem auto 0; text-align: center;">
					A regra dos 3 a 5 minutos, limites de palavras, gestão de pausas e dicas de palco.
				</p>
